        <DisplayString ElementID="HybridSolutionsCloud.HyperVPrivateCloud.Overrides.HybridPureAndS2D.Strict.Discovery"><Name>Hyper-V Private Cloud Monitoring - HybridPureAndS2D Strict Discovery Overrides</Name><Description>Unsealed, customer-owned Strict starter overrides for the HybridPureAndS2D deployment profile. Review in a test management group, customize locally, and export after every change.</Description></DisplayString>
